@host = http://127.0.0.1:58631

### Post a static form without its antiforgery token
POST {{host}}/static-feedback
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

_handler=static-feedback

### Read the public catalog
GET {{host}}/api/books

### Check the app health endpoint
GET {{host}}/healthz

### Post to the local sign-in route without a form token
POST {{host}}/lab/signin/reader

### Compare an unknown POST endpoint
POST {{host}}/nothing-here
